Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.08,0:00:03.08,Note,0,0,0,0,,（忆往昔）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.08,0:00:04.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,睁开你的双眼 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Open your eyes, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.44,0:00:06.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们一起对月长啸吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}And let's go take a howl at that moon.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.34,0:00:07.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,天堂需要你的帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heaven needs your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.82,0:00:08.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,说吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.37,0:00:09.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,丹尼尔和阿迪娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daniel and Adina.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.42,0:00:10.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,得找到他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}They must be found.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.02,0:00:12.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们必须被带回家\N{\fnArial\fs30}They must be brought home,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.27,0:00:14.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,并受到责罚 这是为了所有人\N{\fnArial\fs30}and they must be punished for the sake of all.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.24,0:00:16.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,好好想想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think of it…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.02,0:00:19.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,地狱之王 有迪恩·温彻斯特相助\N{\fnArial\fs30}The king of hell, Dean Winchester by his side.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.49,0:00:23.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们一起统治 一起创建完美的地狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Together we rule. Together we create the perfect hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.36,0:00:27.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们之间萌生的友谊 永远不会结束\N{\fnArial\fs30}And all of this that's bloomed between us never ends.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.25,0:00:29.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,别背对我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! Don't turn your back on me!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.61,0:00:31.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这是干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you think you're doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.07,0:00:32.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想干什么干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, whatever I want.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.06,0:00:33.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是来找迪恩的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're here for Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.44,0:00:34.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我正要把他给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm here to give him to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.56,0:00:36.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,那小混蛋坏我生意\N{\fnArial\fs30}The little prat's bad for business.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.44,0:00:39.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,他…不受控制 一定是因为血印\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's…uncontrollable. Must be the mark.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.03,0:00:40.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的…小伙伴克劳力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your, uh, pal Crowley…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.52,0:00:41.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,出卖你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sold you out.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.22,0:00:43.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们知道怎么治愈恶魔 记得吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, we know how to cure demons. You remember that?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.11,0:00:45.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,一点拉丁文 加上大量的血\N{\fnArial\fs30}Little latin, lot of blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.26,0:00:46.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在你打算怎样 杀了我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what are you gonna do? Are you gonna kill me?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.48,0:00:47.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是我哥哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are my brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.71,0:00:49.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是来带你回家的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm here to take you home.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.05,0:00:50.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真以为那玩意会管用吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You really think those are gonna work?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.25,0:00:55.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,别动 结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop! It's over!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.94,0:00:57.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's over, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.89,0:01:01.69,Note,0,0,0,0,,（如今）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.19,0:01:26.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.11,0:01:27.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,神父\N{\fnArial\fs30}Father.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.61,0:01:34.61,Note,0,0,0,0,,（人血）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.79,0:02:15.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.04,0:02:20.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管怎样\N{\fnArial\fs30}For whatever it's worth,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.44,0:02:22.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我拿的是你的血型的血\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got your blood type.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.42,0:02:27.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆 我知道你想试着治好我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, I know you think you're gonna try and fix me,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.30,0:02:31.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你想过没有 或许我不想被治好\N{\fnArial\fs30}but did it ever occur to you that maybe I don't want to be fixed?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.38,0:02:32.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我过自己的生活吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just let me go live my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.71,0:02:34.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我又不会打搅你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I won't bother you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.11,0:02:36.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在乎什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you care?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.83,0:02:38.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在乎什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do I care?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.45,0:02:46.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.87,0:02:49.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为我会像克劳力一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think I'm just gonna sit here like Crowley,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.13,0:02:51.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,被你注射点血 就眼泪婆娑的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}getting all weepy while you shoot me up?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.01,0:02:53.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,去你的吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, screw that.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.26,0:02:54.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想要这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want this.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.78,0:02:56.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,这我看出来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I pretty much figured that out.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.77,0:02:58.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你根本不确定这能不能好使 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't even know if this is gonna work, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.17,0:03:00.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我体内的东西可不止\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I got a hell of a lot more running through me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.87,0:03:02.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,恶魔能量那么简单\N{\fnArial\fs30}than just demon juice.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.66,0:03:04.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,该隐血印 了解\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mark of cain… got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.31,0:03:05.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.67,0:03:08.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,坐稳了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Buckle up.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.38,0:03:09.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sammy…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.56,0:03:12.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我讨厌打针\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know I hate shots.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.49,0:03:16.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还讨厌恶魔呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hate demons.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.71,0:03:29.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们血还多着呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, we got a whole bunch more of these to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.66,0:03:31.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以让自己好过一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}You could make it a lot easier on yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.89,0:03:59.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,[邪恶力量 第10季第3集]
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.57,0:04:21.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}How are you holding up?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.26,0:04:23.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,挺好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.24,0:04:30.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你嘴上这么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}You say you're fine,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.18,0:04:33.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你看上去不太好\N{\fnArial\fs30}but you don't look fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.10,0:04:35.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,人类就是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's what the humans do.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.95,0:04:37.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们嘴上装没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}They say they're fine,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.39,0:04:40.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,即使我看上去不好\N{\fnArial\fs30}and even if I-I don't look it,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.53,0:04:42.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也要说我气色不错 这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}you say I look well, and in that way,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.15,0:04:45.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就避免谈一件我们都无能为力的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}we avoid talking about something we can do nothing about.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.07,0:04:49.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.05,0:04:52.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就是不明白萨姆·温彻斯特怎么能\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just can't see how Sam Winchester could ask you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.71,0:04:54.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,明知道你的状况 还让你大老远\N{\fnArial\fs30}to drive all this way to help with his brother,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.56,0:04:55.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,开车去帮他哥哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}knowing your condition.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.96,0:05:02.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}He doesn't know…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.96,0:05:05.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的借来的能量消耗得多严重 是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}about how badly your borrowed grace is fading, does he?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.23,0:05:08.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,他有些了解\N{\fnArial\fs30}He knows some.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.50,0:05:11.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,他也不用多说\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he didn't have to ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.46,0:05:14.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,这事上萨姆孤立无援\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam is alone in this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.31,0:05:17.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,他想利用神圣化的血把迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's attempting to change Dean from demon to human.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.17,0:05:19.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,从恶魔变回人类\N{\fnArial\fs30}with a cure of sanctified blood, but…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.90,0:05:22.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这办法没有保证\N{\fnArial\fs30}there's no guarantee that will work.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.27,0:05:26.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果不好使 那么迪恩就已经不在\N{\fnArial\fs30}If it doesn't, then Dean is gone,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.99,0:05:28.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个恶魔必须被解决掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the demon must be dealt with.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.53,0:05:35.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.31,0:05:38.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,担心你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I worry about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.98,0:06:05.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说不定是在要我的命呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}For all you know, you could be killing me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.66,0:06:08.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.06,0:06:11.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只是在耍我\N{\fnArial\fs30}you're just messing with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.81,0:06:14.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管怎样 传说里没有关于\N{\fnArial\fs30}Either way, the lore doesn't say anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.75,0:06:16.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,对血没有反应的案例\N{\fnArial\fs30}about exceptions to the cure.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.64,0:06:19.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,传说\N{\fnArial\fs30}"The lore."
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.59,0:06:23.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,猎人 记录者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hunters… men of letters.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.15,0:06:25.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,都是扯淡\N{\fnArial\fs30}What a load of crap it all is.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.85,0:06:30.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,没话可说吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you got nothin'?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.58,0:06:32.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想要我反驳你吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want me to debate you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.82,0:06:35.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在说话的根本不是真正的你\N{\fnArial\fs30}This isn't even the real you I'm talking to.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.59,0:06:37.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,绝对是真正的我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, it's the real me, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.27,0:06:39.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,新的真我\N{\fnArial\fs30}The new real me…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.86,0:06:42.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个能看清现实的我\N{\fnArial\fs30}The me that sees things for what they really are.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.74,0:06:49.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,温家双煞 行善积德 抗衡自然法则\N{\fnArial\fs30}Winchesters… do-gooders… fighting the natural order.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.34,0:06:50.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我告诉你吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me tell you something…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.01,0:06:52.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这种人 我们就是自然法则\N{\fnArial\fs30}guys like me, we are the natural order.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.56,0:06:53.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,世界本就该如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the way it was set up.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.66,0:06:57.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这样的人 还是得尽力而为\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys like me still got to do what we can.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.56,0:06:59.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,别那么自大 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't be so full of yourself, Sammy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.65,0:07:01.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,依我看\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause, see, from where I'm sitting,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.58,0:07:02.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的变化\N{\fnArial\fs30}there ain't much difference.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.45,0:07:04.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,和你的堕落没什么区别\N{\fnArial\fs30}from what I turned into to what you already are.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.73,0:07:06.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,这话什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what exactly is that supposed to mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.06,0:07:08.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你去找我的时候做了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know what you did when you went looking for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.59,0:07:10.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你做的多过分\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know how far you went.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.54,0:07:12.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,克劳力都告诉我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crowley told me all about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.94,0:07:14.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我问问你\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, let me ask you…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.50,0:07:19.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们俩究竟谁是魔头\N{\fnArial\fs30}…which one of us is really a monster?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.39,0:07:24.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,开始想起来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Starting to come back to you now?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.42,0:07:34.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在怎么办啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}What am I supposed to do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.88,0:07:37.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的人生都结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's like my life is over.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.69,0:07:40.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.84,0:07:43.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,贱人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.33,0:07:45.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我早该预料到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should've seen it coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.54,0:07:50.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么我从来都这么不顺啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why doesn't anything ever work out for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.95,0:07:54.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, there.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.78,0:07:57.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,听上去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sounds like, uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.15,0:08:00.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你最近不太好过啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Things have been a little rough on you lately, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.95,0:08:02.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rough?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.08,0:08:05.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我老婆把我赶走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}My wife kicked me to the curb.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.24,0:08:09.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都4个月没做爱了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We haven't had sex for four months.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.63,0:08:11.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,4个月啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Four.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.34,0:08:15.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过她可是没少做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, not that… not that she hasn't been having plenty…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.85,0:08:18.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,是跟她保龄球队的一个男人\N{\fnArial\fs30}with a guy in her bowling league…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.86,0:08:21.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,那人有纹身\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guy with tattoos.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.26,0:08:25.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去上班 她就在餐桌上干他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did him right there on the kitchen table while I was at work.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.79,0:08:30.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,天呐 这太过分了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man. That's, uh… that's cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.29,0:08:33.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在满心都是复仇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now all I think of is revenge…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.33,0:08:36.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,报复\N{\fnArial\fs30}Payback.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.40,0:08:41.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这是做不到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But that's not gonna happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.53,0:08:43.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,那可未必啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wouldn't be so sure about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.19,0:08:53.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你或许是可以复仇的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is possible that you can… have your revenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.46,0:08:55.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实说起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, hell, it's possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.45,0:08:58.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想要什么都行\N{\fnArial\fs30}you can have pretty much anything you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.01,0:09:02.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想找到我和克劳力\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were trying to get a 20 on Crowley and me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.60,0:09:04.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,为此到处抓恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}from any demon you could snag.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.86,0:09:08.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,但克劳力一心想躲起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}But Crowley didn't want to be found,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.49,0:09:10.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你即使召唤他 他也不来\N{\fnArial\fs30}and no one showed when you summoned.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.24,0:09:13.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你还是想到了办法 不是吗 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you find a way, didn't you, Sam?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.28,0:09:23.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 站在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Stand right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.66,0:09:26.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,等我发话 就读出纸上的字\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I say so, read the words off the paper.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.76,0:09:28.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样能行吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}A-are you sure about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.09,0:09:29.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,没问题 相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.87,0:09:33.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,念吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.79,0:09:35.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, um…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.37,0:09:42.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.55,0:09:44.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,念得不对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tati! Voluntati!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.57,0:09:47.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.69,0:09:50.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁召唤我 什么目的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who summons me, and for what purpose?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.25,0:09:57.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀了我妻子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kill my wife…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.21,0:09:58.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,莱斯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lester!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.06,0:09:59.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的灵魂就归你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and my soul is yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.41,0:10:00.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 别 - 成交\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Don't! - Done.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.99,0:10:02.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.35,0:10:05.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你本希望能在交易完成前及时制止\N{\fnArial\fs30}You would have liked to have gotten there before the deal went down,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.36,0:10:09.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你其实并不在乎可怜的老莱斯特 是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}but you didn't really care about poor ol' Lester, did you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.61,0:10:14.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,再来一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't we try that again?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.52,0:10:18.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人知道克劳力和你哥哥在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody knows where Crowley and your brother are.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.42,0:10:28.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们消失不见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're off the radar!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.07,0:10:41.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,要杀我就动手吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kill me if you want to!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.28,0:10:43.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道别的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's all I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.00,0:10:48.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没什么好跟你说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got nothing for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.68,0:10:52.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,而你却让那个可怜虫出卖了自己的灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you made that poor son of a bitch sell his soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.46,0:10:57.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉你一声 莱斯特是我亲手结果的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, and so you know, I killed Lester myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.94,0:11:00.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,他老婆嫁给纹身男了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that wife of his married the tattooed guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.68,0:11:01.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我本意不是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never meant…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.60,0:11:03.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁管你本意如何呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who cares what you meant?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.28,0:11:05.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们本以为我们和\N{\fnArial\fs30}That line that we thought was so clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.95,0:11:08.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,猎物之间有条清晰的界线\N{\fnArial\fs30}between us and the things that we hunted.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.68,0:11:10.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,但其实没那么清晰 是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}ain't so clear, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.00,0:11:15.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可能比我还烂\N{\fnArial\fs30}You might actually be worse than me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.40,0:11:19.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你利用了一个处于人生低谷的男人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, you took a guy at his lowest, used him,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.64,0:11:23.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,他为此丢了性命和灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}and it cost him his life and his soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.64,0:11:25.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,真厉害\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice work.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.87,0:11:42.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我问你 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me ask you this, Sammy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.27,0:11:45.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果这不好使\N{\fnArial\fs30}If this doesn't work…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.27,0:11:49.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都清楚你要怎么处置我 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}We both know what you got to do to me, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.76,0:11:53.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你下得了手吗 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got the stomach for that, Sam?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.64,0:12:08.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你被控叛国罪\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\*}You stand accused of high treason.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.52,0:12:09.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,带下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take her away.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.58,0:12:13.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,这又是怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what's this, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.80,0:12:16.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,天呐 又是一份等我签字的文件\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, goody… something else to sign.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.62,0:12:19.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,自此以后 立刻生效…\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Henceforth and forthwith…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.54,0:12:22.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,为促进\N{\fnArial\fs30}"For the furtherance.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.64,0:12:26.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,并方便 管理…\N{\fnArial\fs30}and expedience and regulation and…"
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.68,0:12:27.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.63,0:12:29.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,行啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.12,0:12:35.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,陛下 请愿者在苦苦等候\N{\fnArial\fs30}Majesty, supplicants await without.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.18,0:12:37.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,等什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Without what?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.22,0:12:40.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,您的接见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.09,0:12:42.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他们等吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let them wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.64,0:12:44.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们已经等很久了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They've waited a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.47,0:12:46.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里是地狱 就得等\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's hell. You wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.29,0:12:47.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's what you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.46,0:12:52.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么还不走\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're still here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.66,0:12:55.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有天使卡西迪奥的新消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have an update on the angel Castiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.41,0:12:58.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的能量似乎在消退\N{\fnArial\fs30}His grace seems to be fading.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.65,0:13:00.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,他越来越弱了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's losing strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.48,0:13:03.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果有这个想法\N{\fnArial\fs30}If one were so inclined,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.88,0:13:07.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么现在是干掉他的合适时机\N{\fnArial\fs30}this would be a propitious time for one to eliminate him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.06,0:13:09.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你指谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}"One"?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.20,0:13:11.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,您 陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}You, sire.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.78,0:13:16.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,借来的能量的确用不久\N{\fnArial\fs30}Borrowed grace does have a puny shelf life.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.22,0:13:19.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡西迪奥应该仔细阅读警告标签\N{\fnArial\fs30}Castiel should have read the warning label.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.88,0:13:20.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟住他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Follow him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.02,0:13:23.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他的削弱情况时刻报告我\N{\fnArial\fs30}And keep me informed as to his decline.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.86,0:13:34.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.76,0:13:37.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你觉得呢 - 在我的床上搞\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's it look like? - In my bed?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.77,0:13:39.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 混蛋 - 贱人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Jerk. - Bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.20,0:13:41.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 守住 守住 - 闭嘴吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Knock it down. Knock it down! - Stop talking!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.14,0:13:42.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要丢球了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're bodging it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.64,0:13:46.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,地狱之王 有迪恩·温彻斯特相助\N{\fnArial\fs30}The king of hell, Dean Winchester by his side.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.60,0:13:51.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们一起统治 一起创建完美的地狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Together, we rule. Together, we create the perfect hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.64,0:13:54.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,王上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great one?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.93,0:13:58.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your majesty?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.39,0:14:02.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,您还好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you…all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.22,0:14:05.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在回想辉煌岁月\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was thinking of better days.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.16,0:14:07.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 您的休假\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes… your sabbatical.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.59,0:14:08.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}My what?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.69,0:14:10.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们当时很担心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, we were worried, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.55,0:14:12.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,您跟温家哥哥的事故\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your misadventure with the older Winchester.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.93,0:14:15.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,倍受揣测\N{\fnArial\fs30}was quite the topic of speculation.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.69,0:14:20.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,请恕我大胆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, if you'll forgive my boldness…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.32,0:14:24.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以给您做伴\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could now be your wingman.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.08,0:14:27.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,是嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.98,0:14:30.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也喜欢逛派对\N{\fnArial\fs30}I, too, love to party,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.26,0:14:33.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也喜欢女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I do love the ladies.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.02,0:14:34.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有经典摇滚\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the classic rock 'n' roll.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.75,0:14:37.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,最重要的是 我可以跟您一起玩乐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Most importantly, I can debauch by your side.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.01,0:14:39.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,又不会出丑\N{\fnArial\fs30}without being a personal embarrassment.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.40,0:14:41.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,您会看到我的价值的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll see what I'm worth.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.95,0:14:44.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经看出来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I can see already.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.72,0:14:54.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有谁有话说吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyone else care to comment?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.42,0:15:06.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 我又拐错弯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry. I…missed another turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.86,0:15:12.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道主路在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have no idea where the main road is.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.79,0:15:13.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}These things…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.75,0:15:17.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,都那么局限 原始\N{\fnArial\fs30}they're so confining and primitive.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.70,0:15:18.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.87,0:15:22.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的情况越来越糟了 是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's getting worse, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.64,0:15:28.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡西迪奥 我们不能再回避明摆着的事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Castiel, it's time we stopped avoiding the obvious.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.01,0:15:32.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都清楚要怎么解决你的困境和这种局面\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and I both know how to fix this… both you and the situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.13,0:15:35.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能去割破哪个天使的喉咙 盗取那人的能量\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will not slit some angel's throat and steal its grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.71,0:15:36.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也别开口了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Before you say it,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.97,0:15:40.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是绝不会去求梅塔特隆的\N{\fnArial\fs30}we definitely are not going begging to Metatron.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.66,0:15:43.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,那帮助你的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about helping your friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.85,0:15:45.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,把脱逃的天使送回天堂呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}and sending the rogue angels back to heaven?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.72,0:15:48.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想要坚守原则 等死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your preference to die for your principles…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.39,0:15:50.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,这虽然高尚 但毫无意义\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's very noble, but it is meaningless.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.20,0:15:52.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你就继续使命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then you carry on.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.52,0:15:54.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一个人不够\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.65,0:15:57.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,有时候 尽全力就够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sometimes, enough is whatever you have.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.69,0:16:16.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.31,0:16:18.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,小卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.83,0:16:20.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还来吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, are you still coming?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.41,0:16:21.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,就几小时的路了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a few hours away.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.01,0:16:23.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,治疗有效果吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is the treatment working?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.47,0:16:25.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不太好\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, not very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.36,0:16:27.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟克劳力当时的情况不同\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, i-it's not like it was with Crowley.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.20,0:16:28.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩很痛苦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean's in pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.10,0:16:29.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,他真的很痛苦\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, he's in bad pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.96,0:16:32.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,他好像要撑不住了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-It's like he's barely holding on.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.33,0:16:37.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,小卡…我说不定是在害死他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass… I might be killing him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.04,0:16:40.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,有这种可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}It might be.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.67,0:16:41.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以呢…\N{\fnArial\fs30}So…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.53,0:16:43.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么 我该停手吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? Should I stop?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.01,0:16:45.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后又怎么办呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And do what?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.04,0:16:47.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,他又不是被附身\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's not possessed.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.45,0:16:49.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,驱魔也没用\N{\fnArial\fs30}Exorcism is out of the question.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.77,0:16:54.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,净化血仪式是我知道的唯一办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}The ritual of purified blood is the only treatment I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.86,0:16:56.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,小卡 你没听到我说什么了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass, did you not hear what I just said?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.68,0:16:59.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可能是在害死我哥哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could be killing my brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.68,0:17:02.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆 他不是你哥哥了 至少现在不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, he's not your brother … at least not now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.73,0:17:04.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你必须做好准备…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to be prepared for …
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.02,0:17:05.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀死我哥哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Killing my brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.47,0:17:10.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会尽快赶过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be there as soon as I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.32,0:17:11.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.97,0:17:14.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会…给你留门的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll, uh, I'll leave the entry unlocked for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.07,0:17:15.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你…尽快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just… hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.45,0:17:26.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 醒醒啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.79,0:17:27.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 回来 - 不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come back. - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.62,0:17:29.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,回到我身边来 你在吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come back to me. You there?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.74,0:17:31.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 你还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.22,0:17:35.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,还好 假如你…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, if you…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.65,0:17:39.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,认为血液沸腾 快被汗淹死 是「还好」的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}consider drowning in your own sweat while your blood boils okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.94,0:17:45.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 我不能停手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I can't stop doing this.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.30,0:17:46.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你当然可以停手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.95,0:17:48.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就停下就好\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.20,0:17:51.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,如今试图找回你哥哥已经毫无意义了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no point in trying to bring your brother back now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.58,0:17:52.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会把他找回来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I will bring him back.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.81,0:17:54.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,实际上 你…\N{\fnArial\fs30}In fact, your, uh,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.10,0:17:58.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,满心愧疚 承受重担的哥哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}guilt-ridden, weight-of-the-world bro.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.73,0:18:01.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经失踪蛮长一段时间了\N{\fnArial\fs30}has been M.I.A. for quite some time now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.75,0:18:03.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我挺喜欢这副新面目的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I'm loving the new model …
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.86,0:18:05.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,懒散的 刻薄的迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}lean, mean Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.76,0:18:07.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.60,0:18:11.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你发现我试着尽量远离你了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You notice I tried to get as far away from you as possible?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.50,0:18:14.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,远离你的牢骚 你的抱怨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Away from your whining, your complaining.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.90,0:18:17.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我选择了地狱之王 抛弃了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I chose the king of hell over you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.79,0:18:20.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,说不定我只是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe I was just…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.87,0:18:22.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,厌倦了当你的保姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}tired of babysitting you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.55,0:18:25.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,厌倦了整天要救你出火坑\N{\fnArial\fs30}or always having to yank your lame ass out of the fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.14,0:18:26.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,救了一辈子了\N{\fnArial\fs30}since forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.34,0:18:29.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,也说不定…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or maybe …
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.61,0:18:32.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,是因为想到 要不是因为你\N{\fnArial\fs30}maybe it was the fact that my mother would still be alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.71,0:18:34.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我妈妈可能还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}if it wasn't for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.49,0:18:38.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,想到你的存在\N{\fnArial\fs30}That your very existence.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.83,0:18:41.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,夺走了我的生活 榨干了我的生命\N{\fnArial\fs30}sucked the life out of my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.53,0:18:44.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是我哥哥在说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}This isn't my brother talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.93,0:18:46.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你从来就没有过哥哥…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You never had a brother …
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.27,0:18:49.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不过是你软弱的借口\N{\fnArial\fs30}just an excuse for not manning up.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.57,0:18:50.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你猜怎么着\N{\fnArial\fs30}But guess what.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.24,0:18:52.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我放弃\N{\fnArial\fs30}I quit.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.30,0:18:54.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行 你不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No, you don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.61,0:18:55.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能放弃\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't get to quit.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.29,0:18:58.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个家里不允许放弃\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't get to quit in this family.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.37,0:19:00.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们一直以来就只有这个家了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This family is all we have ever had!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.55,0:19:02.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样的话 我们就一无所有了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, then, we got nothin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.97,0:19:03.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会对爸爸说这种话吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you say that to dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.97,0:19:04.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.53,0:19:06.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,这位才厉害呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, there's a prize.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.93,0:19:08.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,这男人给我们洗脑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here's a man who brainwashed us.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.04,0:19:13.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我们浪费生命 为他的必败之战奋斗\N{\fnArial\fs30}into wasting our lives fighting his losing battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.71,0:19:17.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这是在逞男子气概吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is this you manning up?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.89,0:19:23.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这是在把你这混蛋拉出火坑\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is me yanking your lame ass out of the fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.74,0:19:30.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.51,0:19:49.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你强迫他人与阿比顿结盟\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\*}You have coerced others into aligning with Abaddon.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.28,0:19:51.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你散播谣言 质疑挑战\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've spread rumors and fostered doubt.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.10,0:19:54.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,王权的实力和威仪\N{\fnArial\fs30}as to the competence and authority of the crown.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.96,0:19:57.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,叛国罪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guilty of treason.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.91,0:20:00.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,判处死刑\N{\fnArial\fs30}The sentence is death.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.24,0:20:04.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有谁想背叛我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyone else hungry to betray me?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.30,0:20:08.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,下一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Next.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.96,0:20:15.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的罪名是…反正有罪\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're guilty of…something,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.86,0:20:18.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管是什么 反正我不能容忍\N{\fnArial\fs30}which I won't tolerate, whatever it was.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.60,0:20:20.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你将被…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are condemned to…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.30,0:20:22.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,够了 停\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop! Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.12,0:20:24.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.44,0:20:25.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}You cannot do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.03,0:20:28.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没长眼吗 我当然可以 我已经做了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Weren't you watching? 'course I can. I just did.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.56,0:20:30.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就打算这么统治吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is your idea of ruling?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.00,0:20:32.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.01,0:20:33.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们为了你杀人 虐待人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've killed and tortured for you,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.12,0:20:36.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,窃取灵魂 摧毁生命\N{\fnArial\fs30}stolen souls, destroyed lives,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.65,0:20:39.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,为博你赏识吃尽苦头\N{\fnArial\fs30}tempted and tormented with distinction.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.88,0:20:41.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我们得到的奖赏是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}And for all this, what's our reward?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.77,0:20:45.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,一记响亮的耳光\N{\fnArial\fs30}A slap in the face.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.56,0:20:49.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.60,0:20:52.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说走就走 饮血狂欢\N{\fnArial\fs30}You disappear, binge on blood,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.62,0:20:54.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,还差点有了人性\N{\fnArial\fs30}approach the edge of becoming human.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.96,0:20:55.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,更雪上加霜的是\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the salt in the wound…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.98,0:20:58.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你跟你的小男宠迪恩·温彻斯特一起跑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}you run off with your boy toy, Dean Winchester,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.18,0:20:59.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在他成了杀人狂\N{\fnArial\fs30}and now he's running amok,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.20,0:21:00.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你根本控制不了他 还有这王国\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you can't control him or the kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.07,0:21:01.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在干什么啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's he doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.48,0:21:03.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你辜负了我们的忠诚\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've squandered our loyalty.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.27,0:21:06.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想怎样\N{\fnArial\fs30}What will you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.21,0:21:08.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,反正不要活在你创造的地狱里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not live in the hell you've made.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.23,0:21:13.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,是圣油\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's holy oil!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.52,0:21:18.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,退后 退后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get back! Get back!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.15,0:21:31.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,没想到啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did not see that coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.04,0:21:47.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,汉娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, Hannah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.90,0:21:51.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道 我们走的这条路非常危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, this… this road we're on, it's… it's dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.76,0:21:53.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.26,0:21:58.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不能迷路\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't afford to lose our way.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.33,0:22:01.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 地图的事很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know that. I'm sorry about the map.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.28,0:22:05.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,绝不能绕路\N{\fnArial\fs30}No detours of any kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.44,0:22:09.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡西迪奥 如果你又是想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Castiel, if these are metaphors.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.69,0:22:12.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,像人类那样用隐喻跟我交流\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you're attempting another human communication,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.94,0:22:14.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,没用的\N{\fnArial\fs30}it isn't working.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.99,0:22:19.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只想说这任务至关重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just trying to say that this mission is everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.02,0:22:22.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.60,0:22:25.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,去找迪恩 去追捕逃脱天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}Getting to Dean and hunting these rogues…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.48,0:22:29.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在能量不足 所以我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I… I'm not at full capacity, so I…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.46,0:22:33.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们 一定要专注\N{\fnArial\fs30}We n-need total focus.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.15,0:22:36.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,像激光一样 明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like a laser. Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.77,0:22:40.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟人类相处了很长时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just…I've been around humans for long enough to see…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.02,0:22:42.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道分心有多容易\N{\fnArial\fs30}how easily distractions occur.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.52,0:22:46.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,「分心」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Distractions."
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.47,0:22:50.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切的情绪 感情\N{\fnArial\fs30}Emotions…feelings…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.83,0:22:53.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,都是危险的诱惑\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're dangerous temptations.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.91,0:22:56.96,Title,0,0,0,0,,多像《圣经》说的啊 卡西迪奥\N{\fnArial\fs30}How very biblical, Castiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.07,0:23:01.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我并不是想不近人情\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't mean to be unkind.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.58,0:23:03.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你并不需要友善\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't need to be kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.87,0:23:05.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.18,0:23:09.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是想明确一下我们的首要目标\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm trying to keep our priorities clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.03,0:23:11.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,那不用担心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not to worry, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.32,0:23:14.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很清楚我的首要目标 还有你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am very clear on my priorities. And yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.46,0:23:40.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.73,0:24:05.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,久违了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, there.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.21,0:24:09.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我追踪你们好几天了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been tracking you for days.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.47,0:24:11.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们会为你们的所作所为受到惩罚\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will be punished for what you did.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.60,0:24:14.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,丹尼尔的死 是个意外 阿迪娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daniel's death … that was unintentional, Adina.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.72,0:24:15.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得你明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}I feel you know this.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.75,0:24:16.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,意外\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unintentional?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.20,0:24:18.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你杀了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}You killed him!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.65,0:24:22.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,来真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.92,0:24:32.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀了我吧 放她走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just… kill me. But let her go.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.28,0:24:34.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,住手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.04,0:24:38.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,「住手」 「杀了我」 好多建议\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Stop." "Kill me." I mean, so many suggestions,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.19,0:24:39.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,真不知道该怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know what to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.74,0:24:41.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道我会杀了你 卡西迪奥\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know … I will kill you, Castiel,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.99,0:24:43.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,但会很慢 很慢\N{\fnArial\fs30}But very, very slowly.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.24,0:24:46.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样 你的小甜心就可以观赏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So your … your honeybunch can watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.55,0:24:49.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sound good?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.36,0:26:44.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, champ.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.69,0:26:47.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.21,0:26:50.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,像被车碾过的动物一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Talk about roadkill.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.39,0:27:11.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好 汉娜 痛苦吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\*}Attagirl, Hannah. Suffer.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.73,0:27:14.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像我的丹尼尔被你们杀死前那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just like my Daniel suffered before you killed him.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.59,0:27:17.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,丹尼尔的死不怪我 怪你们自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daniel's death isn't on my head. It's on yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.99,0:27:19.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们什么都没做\N{\fnArial\fs30}We did nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.22,0:27:23.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们只想独自生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}We wanted nothing but to be left alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.93,0:27:26.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们杀了个天使 必须为此付出代价\N{\fnArial\fs30}You killed an angel. You had to answer for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.78,0:27:29.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个要把我们强行拖回你们的天堂的天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}An angel who would have hauled us back to that heaven of yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.36,0:27:33.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们一开始就该放过我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should have left us alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.81,0:27:35.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,够了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that will do.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.80,0:27:52.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们为什么就不能像大家想象的那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why can't you people just sit on clouds and play harps,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.94,0:27:55.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,坐在云端弹竖琴呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}like you're supposed to?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.17,0:29:30.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,出来吧 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Sammy!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.39,0:29:34.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,不想和哥哥玩玩吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you want to hang out with your big brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.42,0:29:36.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,共享一点欢乐时光\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spend a little quality time?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.21,0:29:45.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,别傻了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't be an idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.61,0:29:47.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是她的 但她正要杀你女朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, it's hers, but she was killing your girlfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.68,0:29:49.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你自己没动手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your hands are clean.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.17,0:29:52.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我讨厌这么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Much as it pains me to say this,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.27,0:29:53.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你死了对我没好处\N{\fnArial\fs30}you're useless to me dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.93,0:30:13.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你欠我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You owe me.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.19,0:30:18.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么帮我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why did you help me?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.40,0:30:19.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,纯粹是利益需要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Purely business.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.54,0:30:21.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你离温家兄弟俱乐部会所只有5英里远\N{\fnArial\fs30}Since you're 5 miles away from the Winchesters' clubhouse,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.96,0:30:24.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜你们一定正往那儿赶吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can only surmise that you're headed there.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.35,0:30:27.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,而迪恩的事很棘手\N{\fnArial\fs30}and that Dean has become a handful.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.18,0:30:30.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,他变成恶魔后 除了给我添堵 毫无益处\N{\fnArial\fs30}Having him as a demon has caused me nothing but grief.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.51,0:30:32.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,去解决这问题吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fix the problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.64,0:30:36.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你应该知道 最坏的情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}You realize … worse comes to worst,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.57,0:30:37.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,是得杀了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}that means killing him.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.64,0:30:41.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是多愁善感的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not sentimental.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.83,0:31:47.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,聪明 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Smart, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.82,0:31:50.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,封锁地堡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Locking the place down.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.02,0:31:53.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,门打不开 我明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doors won't open. I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.75,0:31:56.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,但关键是\N{\fnArial\fs30}But here's the thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.11,0:31:59.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want to leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.70,0:32:02.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,直到我找到你为止\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not till I find you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.87,0:32:15.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sammy!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.07,0:32:20.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样对你更不妙了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're just making this worse for yourself, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.26,0:32:24.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,顺便说一句\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, by the way,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.12,0:32:28.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能逃脱都怪你\N{\fnArial\fs30}you can, uh…blame yourself for me getting loose.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.65,0:32:33.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你给我注入的血液 让我更有人性\N{\fnArial\fs30}All that blood you pumped into me to make me human … well.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.00,0:32:36.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我越不像恶魔 手铐作用就越小\N{\fnArial\fs30}The less demon I was, the less the cuffs worked.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.22,0:32:41.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,而恶魔陷阱\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that devil's trap …
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.69,0:32:44.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我直接能走过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I just walked right across it.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.39,0:32:46.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,它虽然厉害\N{\fnArial\fs30}It smarted.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.21,0:32:49.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}But still…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.12,0:33:32.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,这才像话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, that's more like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.58,0:33:41.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是你的大招吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's your big move?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.18,0:33:43.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我说 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen to me, Dean!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.18,0:33:46.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要成功了 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were getting close, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.49,0:33:48.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你还在\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you're still in there somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.98,0:33:50.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我完成治疗吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just let me finish the treatments.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.49,0:33:56.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.86,0:34:02.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说得好像我想被治愈似的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You act like I want to be cured.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.76,0:34:10.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,就我而言 我喜欢这病\N{\fnArial\fs30}Personally, I like the disease.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.55,0:34:13.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 住手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean! Stop that!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.37,0:34:15.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想对你用刀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I don't want to use this blade on you!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.35,0:34:19.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,这对你来说可太糟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That sucks for you, doesn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.50,0:34:21.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你真是这么想的\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause you really mean that.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.15,0:34:24.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你从那房间出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, if you come out of that room,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.60,0:34:25.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就别无选择了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I won't have a choice!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.72,0:34:26.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你当然有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure you will!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.92,0:34:29.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且我知道你会怎么选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I know which one you'll make.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.98,0:34:31.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是吗 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Isn't that right, Sammy?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.16,0:34:35.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你瞧 是这样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, see… here's the thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.83,0:34:38.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很幸运 我非常幸运\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm lucky. Oh, hell, I'm blessed.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.05,0:34:40.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为 我身体内还留有足够的魔性\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause there's just enough demon left in me.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.57,0:34:43.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀死你 根本不需要犹豫\N{\fnArial\fs30}that killing you ain't no choice at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.63,0:34:54.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sammy?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.74,0:35:02.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,来啊 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Sammy!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.74,0:35:06.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们一起喝杯啤酒 聊一聊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's have a beer, talk about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.45,0:35:09.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我玩够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm tired of playing.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.99,0:35:12.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们结束游戏吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's finish this game!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.26,0:35:28.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞧你啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well…look at you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.25,0:35:33.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,动手啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.87,0:35:39.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,就看你的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.87,0:35:52.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.92,0:35:55.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, it's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.83,0:36:01.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.00,0:36:18.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们到底在干什么 小卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell are we doing to him, Cass?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.06,0:36:20.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我给了他那么多血\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, even after I gave him all that blood,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.68,0:36:22.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,他还是说不想被治愈\N{\fnArial\fs30}he still said he didn't want to be cured,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.24,0:36:25.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,不想做人类\N{\fnArial\fs30}that he didn't want to be human.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.26,0:36:28.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能理解他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well… I see his point.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.20,0:36:33.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有人类才能真正感受快乐 但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, only humans can feel real joy, but…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.16,0:36:36.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,同样也有沉重的痛苦\N{\fnArial\fs30}also such profound pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.24,0:36:38.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样更容易些\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is easier.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.81,0:37:12.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们看起来很担心\N{\fnArial\fs30}You look worried, fellas.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.22,0:37:26.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎回来 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome back, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.83,0:37:51.16,Note,0,0,0,0,,（驱魔指导）
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.47,0:38:03.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,他怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}How's he doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.72,0:38:06.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有点迷迷糊糊\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's, uh… he's still a little out of it,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.42,0:38:07.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我觉得好多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}but better, I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.23,0:38:09.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得整件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, I think this whole thing …
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.23,0:38:12.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,血液治疗 这一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}The blood cure and the… all of it …
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.16,0:38:15.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 真的让他很累 - 是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Really wrecked him, you know? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.20,0:38:17.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,从好的方面说 他又饿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}On the plus side, he's hungry again,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.84,0:38:20.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我要去给他拿一大袋垃圾食品\N{\fnArial\fs30}so I'm just gonna go pick him up a big ol' bag of crap food.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.64,0:38:22.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后亲自填饱他\N{\fnArial\fs30}and stuff it in his face myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.10,0:38:26.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你能帮我盯着点吗 - 好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You mind keeping an eye? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.25,0:38:29.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 萨姆 - 嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sam? - Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.80,0:38:31.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道 解决了一个问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}You realize … one problem is solved,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.62,0:38:33.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,但还有一个问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}but one still remains.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.56,0:38:35.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩不再是恶魔 这是没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean is no longer a demon. That's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.30,0:38:39.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他还有该隐的血印\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the mark of Cain … that, he still has,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.21,0:38:41.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,那迟早会是麻烦\N{\fnArial\fs30}and sooner or later, that's gonna be an issue.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.06,0:38:43.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道吗 小卡 我很累了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what, Cass? I'm beat, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.90,0:38:46.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,一次一场战斗 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}One battle at a time, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.77,0:38:50.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去给我哥哥拿点胆固醇食物\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I'm just gonna go grab my brother some cholesterol.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.43,0:38:54.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后我要把自己灌醉\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then I'm gonna get drunk.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.07,0:39:19.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.02,0:39:22.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看起来很糟糕\N{\fnArial\fs30}You look terrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.94,0:39:26.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,偶尔说说谎不会要你命的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, it wouldn't kill you to lie every now and again.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.26,0:39:29.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,是不会 我只是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it wouldn't kill me. I just…you …
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.95,0:39:31.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,算了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forget it.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.66,0:39:34.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,而你呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you, on the other hand, you…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.66,0:39:37.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,看起来很不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looking good.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.97,0:39:40.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你又回来啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}So…are you back?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.77,0:39:42.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少暂时是\N{\fnArial\fs30}At least temporarily.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.17,0:39:47.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,说来话长 克劳力 偷来的能量\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, it's a long story … Crowley, stolen grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.28,0:39:49.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,外面汽车里有个女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a female outside in the car.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.06,0:39:52.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,下次吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Another time.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.14,0:39:57.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你及时帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, thank you for, um… stepping in when you did.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.90,0:40:03.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆怎么说 他要离婚吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What does Sam say? Does he want a divorce?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.70,0:40:06.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我确定萨姆知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sure Sam knows.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.25,0:40:09.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,不论你说了什么 做了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}that whatever you said or what you did,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.49,0:40:11.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,那都不是真正的你\N{\fnArial\fs30}that wasn't really you.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.70,0:40:13.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,反正不全都是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}It certainly wasn't all you.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.81,0:40:15.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想杀了他 小卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}I tried to kill him, Cass.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.40,0:40:18.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 你们俩经历了那么多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, you two have been through so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.53,0:40:21.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们是兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, you're brothers.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.28,0:40:23.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,想用锤子杀了他 还不至于会\N{\fnArial\fs30}It'd take a lot more than trying to kill Sam with a hammer.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.38,0:40:25.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他逼走\N{\fnArial\fs30}to make him want to walk away.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.35,0:40:28.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我们的生活得糟到什么地步才会这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}You realize how screwed up our lives are that even makes sense?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.13,0:40:32.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很高兴你来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm glad you're here, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.23,0:40:42.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许你该先休息一阵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, maybe you should, um…take some time.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.48,0:40:44.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,恢复一下 再投入工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}before you get back to work … allow yourself to heal.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.66,0:40:46.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,这\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's, uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.06,0:40:49.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么说呢 时机也许正合适\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. Timing might be right.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.01,0:40:52.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,天堂和地狱 似乎都恢复了秩序\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heaven and hell … they seem reasonably back in order.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.39,0:40:54.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,外面很平静\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's quiet out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.40,0:41:12.16,Note,0,0,0,0,,（俄克拉荷马州 塔尔萨）
